\subsection*{5. Data Ingestion Pipeline}

\paragraph{5.1 OMNIWeb Solar Wind Telemetry}
Solar wind plasma parameters and IMF vectors are ingested at 1-minute
cadence. Extreme forcing scenarios use synthetic Carrington-class
profiles.

\paragraph{5.2 IERS Earth Orientation Parameters}
Polar motion $(x_p, y_p)$ and UT1-UTC corrections are applied to maintain
geodetic consistency.

\paragraph{5.3 EGM2008 Harmonic Tables}
Spherical harmonic coefficients $C_{\ell m}$ are loaded into the Unified
State Tensor Cache for gravitational field evaluation.

