\begin{itemize}
    \item Binary reduction trees replace non-associative atomic FP operations.
    \item All random perturbations seeded with:
    \[
    \texttt{0x5A43534520102601}.
    \]
    \item Strict FP64 mode enforced for all metric and gravitational
          computations.
\end{itemize}

