\subsection*{7. Stress-Test Configuration}

\paragraph{7.1 Space Weather Forcing}
Carrington-class solar wind conditions:
\[
P_{sw} > 25\ \text{nPa},\qquad |B_z| > 120\ \text{nT}.
\]

\paragraph{7.2 Magnetopause Compression}
AG-CSE stably resolves magnetopause collapse from:
\[
10.2 R_E \rightarrow 3.8 R_E.
\]

\paragraph{7.3 Divergence Cleaning}
Generalized Lagrangian Multiplier (GLM) method maintains:
\[
\nabla\cdot\mathbf{B} < 10^{-15}.
\]

