\section*{Summary}
The AG-CSE v1.0 methods integrate high-order numerical schemes,
relativistic physics, adaptive mesh refinement, and real-time geophysical
data ingestion into a unified, deterministic simulation framework capable
of machine-precision stability under extreme astrophysical conditions.